          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "title": "Explicitly Not Part of This Contract",
        "body": "- Not the script API or its permissions: those say how a write happens, not what may be written.\n- Not the storage format of a graph. Where a switch is written is part of the contract; how the file is serialised is not.\n- Not a promise that every switch has a control in the Properties panel.",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "authoring-contract"
